# Support Ticket Classification & Prioritization

## Objective
Build a machine learning model to classify support tickets and predict ticket priorities.

## Tools Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NLTK
- Scikit-learn
- Matplotlib
- Jupyter Notebook

## Dataset
Customer Support Ticket Dataset (Kaggle)

## Workflow
1. Data Loading
2. Data Exploration
3. Text Cleaning
4. TF-IDF Vectorization
5. Ticket Type Classification
6. Priority Prediction
7. Model Evaluation

## Results

### Ticket Type Classification
Accuracy: 19.42%

### Priority Prediction
Accuracy: 25.62%

## Conclusion
The dataset was processed using NLP techniques and TF-IDF vectorization. Multinomial Naive Bayes models were trained for ticket classification and priority prediction. The results indicate that the available text features have a weak relationship with the target labels, limiting predictive performance.